OL,3,GNEWSAMy weight rose to 20 stone after I
OL,4,Aretired - Asley Giles
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer England cricketer Ashley Giles
OL,7,Fhas revealed his weight ballooned to
OL,8,Fabout 20 stone (127kg) after he
OL,9,Fretired.
OL,11,FGiles, 53, played 54 Tests and 62
OL,12,Fone-day internationals for England
OL,13,Fbetween 1997 and 2006, the highlight
OL,14,Fbeing his key role in 2005 when England
OL,15,Freclaimed the Ashes from Australia for
OL,16,Fthe first time in 18 years.
OL,18,FSince retiring, Giles has held several
OL,19,Froles within the game, both as a coach
OL,20,Fand administrator. He is currently
OL,21,Fchief executive of Worcestershire
OL,22,FCounty Cricket Club.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
